                       wall on the authenticated client); yt probes which client can fetch
                       BEFORE playing and uses the working one, so playback stays clean.
                       Set to "none" to force anonymous-only (skips the keychain read and
                       the probe). Reading the cookie DB is most reliable with browser closed.
  YT_AUDIO_FORMAT      Default audio stream format (default: ba/b)
  YT_VIDEO_FORMAT      Default video stream format (default: bv*+ba/b)
  YT_VIDEO_FORMAT_FAST Fast-start progressive stream format
